{"sections":{"image_banner":{"type":"image-banner","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Inspired_by_Cinderella_1200_x_400_px_12.svg","image_overlay_opacity":0,"image_height":"adapt","image_behavior":"none","desktop_content_position":"middle-center","desktop_content_alignment":"center","show_text_box":false,"color_scheme":"scheme-1","stack_images_on_mobile":true,"mobile_content_alignment":"center","show_text_below":false}},"image_with_text_4rrWpk":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_JfPGDy":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"<strong>Chiang Mai & Chiang Rai – Northern Thailand<\/strong>","heading_size":"h2"}},"text_ggcHNL":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>A land of misty mountains, lush jungles, elephant sanctuaries, and ancient temples hidden in the greenery. Take river cruises, bamboo rafting trips, and jungle treks that feel straight out of an expedition logbook.<\/p><p><strong>Click <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/travefy.com\/f\/6ws9rqkqdm6qra2uwxzbsp2cw3vtttj3ha\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/travefy.com\/f\/6ws9rqkqdm6qra2uwxzbsp2cw3vtttj3ha\"><strong>HERE<\/strong><\/a><strong> to discover Thailand’s jungle magic and write your next story.<\/strong><\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["heading_JfPGDy","text_ggcHNL"],"name":"t:sections.image-with-text.presets.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/237596_636e1627ead9d.jpg","height":"medium","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","image_behavior":"none","content_layout":"overlap","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","mobile_content_alignment":"left","section_color_scheme":"","color_scheme":"","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"image_with_text_wHPt4n":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_kxNwiW":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"<strong>Vietnam – Ninh Binh & the Mekong Delta<\/strong>","heading_size":"h2"}},"text_4PUjgq":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Glide through emerald waterways, towering limestone cliffs, and lush rice fields in Ninh Binh—often called “Halong Bay on land.” The narrow rivers, hidden caves, and jungle-covered peaks feel like a real-life expedition waiting to unfold. Further south, the Mekong Delta offers floating markets, winding canals, and vibrant river life that transport you straight into the heart of an adventurous river journey.<\/p><p><strong>Click <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/travefy.com\/f\/6ws9rqkqdm6qra2uwxzbsp2cw3vtttj3ha\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/travefy.com\/f\/6ws9rqkqdm6qra2uwxzbsp2cw3vtttj3ha\"><strong>HERE<\/strong><\/a><strong> to drift into your own riverbound tale through Vietnam.<\/strong><\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["heading_kxNwiW","text_4PUjgq"],"name":"t:sections.image-with-text.presets.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/trang-an.jpg","height":"medium","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","image_behavior":"none","content_layout":"overlap","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","mobile_content_alignment":"left","section_color_scheme":"","color_scheme":"","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"image_with_text_EBCCWn":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_KxPYmx":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"<strong>Sri Lanka – Jungles, Rivers & Ancient Wonders<\/strong>","heading_size":"h2"}},"text_Vrhadp":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>From rainforest reserves alive with birdsong to river safaris winding past lush jungle banks, Sri Lanka is a paradise for explorers. Trek through misty tea fields, venture into national parks filled with elephants, or uncover ancient temples hidden within the greenery. With wildlife, culture, and scenery blending together, Sri Lanka feels like a vivid storybook filled with discovery at every turn.<\/p><p><strong>Click <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/travefy.com\/f\/6ws9rqkqdm6qra2uwxzbsp2cw3vtttj3ha\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/travefy.com\/f\/6ws9rqkqdm6qra2uwxzbsp2cw3vtttj3ha\"><strong>HERE<\/strong><\/a><strong> to begin your Sri Lankan chapter and step into a world of colour and adventure.<\/strong><\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["heading_KxPYmx","text_Vrhadp"],"name":"t:sections.image-with-text.presets.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/sinharaja-forest-reserve-rainforest-sri-lanka-137_jpg.webp","height":"medium","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","image_behavior":"none","content_layout":"overlap","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","mobile_content_alignment":"left","section_color_scheme":"","color_scheme":"","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"image_with_text_dYxihL":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"heading_i46LR4":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"<strong>Disney Parks Around the World<\/strong>","heading_size":"h2"}},"text_QiUHhp":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Experience the iconic Jungle Cruise attraction at Disneyland California, Magic Kingdom at Walt Disney World, and Tokyo Disneyland. Board your riverboat, listen to the skipper’s world-famous jokes, and journey through animatronic jungles, ancient ruins, and surprising wildlife scenes.<\/p><p><strong>Click <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/travefy.com\/f\/6ws9rqkqdm6qra2uwxzbsp2cw3vtttj3ha\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/travefy.com\/f\/6ws9rqkqdm6qra2uwxzbsp2cw3vtttj3ha\"><strong>HERE<\/strong><\/a><strong> to begin your Disney Parks chapter and experience the classic Jungle Cruise magic.<\/strong><\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["heading_i46LR4","text_QiUHhp"],"name":"t:sections.image-with-text.presets.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/210712153839-disneyland-jungle-cruise-ride-0709-restricted.jpg","height":"medium","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","image_behavior":"none","content_layout":"overlap","desktop_content_position":"top","desktop_content_alignment":"left","mobile_content_alignment":"left","section_colo